{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三，順此方言，即歸命三寶，上總下別"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "頂禮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聖者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "徧照"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "應供"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正等覺，即頂禮聖者徧照如來、應供、正等覺。上佛寶，其法寶在宗旨\n中，故此略耳。下僧寶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦云稽首"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聖者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "普"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "賢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "略云菩薩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大勇猛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大悲者，即稽首聖者普賢菩薩大勇猛大悲者。次正明宗旨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所為"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "智"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "燈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無盡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "藏，即所為智燈\n無盡藏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "辨才"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "具，即辨才具"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所觀，即一切佛所觀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "相應"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圓成，順此方言，即圓\n成相應"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甚深"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "難測，即前圓成甚深難測"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圓成，即三世圓成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "正覺心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "能生，順此方言，即能生正覺心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以灌頂法而灌\n其頂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "海"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出生，即從法海出生無礙解"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無間斷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聞，順此方言，於諸佛所無間聽聞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "普"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "賢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "地"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出生，順此方言，即出生大普賢地"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "獲得，順此方言，獲得受記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "成就\n人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "作禮，即十地人之所作禮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "略云菩薩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出生，順此方言，出生一切菩薩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世尊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "覺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "母，順此方言，佛世尊母"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此十\n二字，其義深密，唯佛能知，依字釋者，亦得者為三業清淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "極智"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "離義、到義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無住義，即大極智，離此到彼，無住涅槃"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X26n0520_p0589a02"}
